{"id":400605101,"chapter_id":21000101,"scene_id":104,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"飘忽的幻影","content":"错了，错了……重来……重新计算……回到第34步……不，我还能前进，让我证明……","voice":["vo_event_400605101_01"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06051","style":1,"background":2066,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"飘忽的幻影","content":"我们见过千万光年外的星辰，我们的记忆……代代传递……不会是无用功，人所相信的，不会是虚无……","voice":["vo_event_400605101_02"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06051","style":1,"background":2066,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"她的意识恍惚，脚下的淤泥逐渐攀上她的身体。你看到眼泪不断滑落，像是她最后的清明。","style":3,"background":2066,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"options":["学者！"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"background":2066,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"你得不到回答了，一个灰暗的怪物缓缓缠上学者稀薄的身影。","style":3,"background":2066,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"混沌的低语","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>太晚了……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_400605101_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06051","style":1,"background":2066,"log_type":1}]}